{"v":1,"kind":"observation","eventId":"event-fact-pref-1","factId":"fact-pref-1","date":"2026-10-05","section":"about-preferences","text":"I prefer remote roles, except when a role offers regular mentoring in Saltmere, so I can ask questions and learn with the team before I decide if it suits me.","category":"preference","source":{"fileId":"history-words-pref-1","sha256":"37ac193e339ad7b7563b88b8e0a7cf829d57bf685bbaf39b0a5aa5d6837cfc4c"},"origin":{"kind":"words","runId":"history-run-1","captureId":"f9be191d6f1b52015a7501db747e13374277f8d835835f835d92ae8fb03bcaad","pileId":"history-pref-1"}}
{"v":1,"kind":"observation","eventId":"event-fact-pref-2","factId":"fact-pref-2","date":"2026-10-05","section":"about-preferences","text":"I like short written updates that say what changed, why it changed and what comes next, in plain words, so I can follow a change without opening other notes.","category":"preference","source":{"fileId":"history-words-pref-2","sha256":"d2d550742e27f78b52b1faca47a89ee1e05072a598fab779f7bca936faac4e77"},"origin":{"kind":"words","runId":"history-run-1","captureId":"f9be191d6f1b52015a7501db747e13374277f8d835835f835d92ae8fb03bcaad","pileId":"history-pref-2"}}
{"v":1,"kind":"observation","eventId":"event-fact-pref-3","factId":"fact-pref-3","date":"2026-10-05","section":"about-preferences","text":"I want a small list of roles with clear tasks and regular feedback, so I can compare each one with care before I draft a reply and keep it for later.","category":"preference","source":{"fileId":"history-words-pref-3","sha256":"e5d2addfc010cf64caf776e036c2efab8051cc14761e6dc07b83535723ce4b26"},"origin":{"kind":"words","runId":"history-run-1","captureId":"f9be191d6f1b52015a7501db747e13374277f8d835835f835d92ae8fb03bcaad","pileId":"history-pref-3"}}
{"v":1,"kind":"consolidation","eventId":"history-frontier-1","section":"about-preferences","date":"2026-10-05","factIds":["fact-pref-1","fact-pref-2","fact-pref-3"],"runId":"history-run-1","operationId":"history-op-1","successful":true}
{"v":1,"kind":"observation","eventId":"event-fact-pref-4","factId":"fact-pref-4","date":"2026-10-06","section":"about-preferences","text":"I like garden plans that keep the path by the amber gate in Saltmere clear, with watering jobs said plainly and room to carry a can past the beds.","category":"preference","source":{"fileId":"history-words-pref-4","sha256":"8ad6f3c3cca941e5595b52ba3ff0afc6d874fe9ff9dcb8edb16b3483cb12de4a"},"origin":{"kind":"words","runId":"history-run-2","captureId":"47c81eeeaee6426b70bf2b2502a01c520c2012970c30256c3588b67216511544","pileId":"history-pref-4"}}
{"v":1,"kind":"observation","eventId":"event-fact-pref-5","factId":"fact-pref-5","date":"2026-10-06","section":"about-preferences","text":"I want recipe notes to keep each ingredient next to its step, say when to add it and keep the first amounts, and never guess a new serving size from a summary.","category":"preference","source":{"fileId":"history-words-pref-5","sha256":"af5ee362f881b41881376bdd506ae053f241e7e7fb81b41e5fed829d8dd80def"},"origin":{"kind":"words","runId":"history-run-2","captureId":"47c81eeeaee6426b70bf2b2502a01c520c2012970c30256c3588b67216511544","pileId":"history-pref-5"}}
{"v":1,"kind":"observation","eventId":"event-fact-pref-6","factId":"fact-pref-6","date":"2026-10-06","section":"about-preferences","text":"I like travel notes that keep the meeting place and the first date, with any weather conditions, and never treat a maybe plan as a booked trip until I say so.","category":"preference","source":{"fileId":"history-words-pref-6","sha256":"a80206f4da829c1a156a1439ea27fd65d61e6c625ea9af0c59cb619300214e90"},"origin":{"kind":"words","runId":"history-run-2","captureId":"47c81eeeaee6426b70bf2b2502a01c520c2012970c30256c3588b67216511544","pileId":"history-pref-6"}}
